00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:08,239
PREFACE The artist is the creator of beautiful things. To reveal art and

2
00:00:08,239 --> 00:00:13,239
conceal the artist is art’s aim. The critic is he who can translate into

3
00:00:13,239 --> 00:00:17,640
another manner or a new material his impression of beautiful

4
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:22,840
things. The highest as the lowest form of criticism is a mode of

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:27,159
autobiography. Those who find ugly meanings in beautiful things are corrupt

6
00:00:27,159 --> 00:00:30,600
without being charming. This is a fault.

7
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:35,600
Those who find beautiful meanings in beautiful things are the cultivated. For

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:40,679
these there is hope. They are the elect to whom beautiful things mean only

9
00:00:40,679 --> 00:00:45,878
beauty. There is no such thing as a moral or an immoral book. Books are well

10
00:00:45,878 --> 00:00:49,799
written, or badly written. That is all.

11
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:55,118
The 19th century dislike of realism is the rage of Caliban seeing his own face in a

12
00:00:55,118 --> 00:01:00,680
glass. The 19th century dislike of romanticism is the rage of Caliban not

13
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:06,118
seeing his own face in a glass. The moral life of man forms part

14
00:01:06,118 --> 00:01:11,118
of the subject matter of the artist, but the morality of art consists

15
00:01:11,118 --> 00:01:16,519
in the perfect use of an imperfect medium. No artist desires to prove

16
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:21,680
anything. Even things that are true can be proved. No artist has ethical

17
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:27,200
sympathies. An ethical sympathy in an artist is an unpardonable mannerism of

18
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:31,719
style. No artist is ever morbid. The artist can express everything. Thought

19
00:01:31,719 --> 00:01:36,680
and language are to the artist instruments of an art. Vice and virtue

20
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:40,118
are to the artist materials for an art.

21
00:01:40,118 --> 00:01:44,359
From the point of view of form, the type of all the arts is the art of the

22
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:49,078
musician. From the point of view of feeling, the actor’s craft is the the

23
00:01:49,078 --> 00:01:54,478
type. All art is at once surface and symbol. Those who go beneath the surface

24
00:01:54,478 --> 00:02:00,000
do so at their peril. Those who read the symbol do so at their peril. It is the

25
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,639
spectator, and not life, that art really mirrors. Diversity of opinion about a

26
00:02:06,639 --> 00:02:13,680
work of art shows that the work is new, complex, and vital. When critics disagree,

27
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:18,519
the artist is in accord with himself. We can forgive a man for making a useful

28
00:02:18,519 --> 00:02:24,519
thing as long as he does not admire it. The only excuse for making a useless

29
00:02:24,519 --> 00:02:27,039
thing is that one admires it intensely.

30
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:31,000
All art is quite useless. OSCAR
